operate and how to protect their interests when a dispute escalates.<\/p><h3>Nationally Recognized Crypto Fraud &amp; Recovery Leadership<\/h3><p>Attorney <a href=\"https:\\/\\/bergpcc.com\\/lawyers\/geoffrey-berg\/\">Geoff Berg<\/a> has become one of the nation\u2019s leading <a href=\"https:\\/\\/bergpcc.com\\/practice-areas\/crypto-litigation\/fraud-recovery\/\">crypto-fraud litigators<\/a>. His work has been featured on ABC News, CNN, ABC13, HBO, NBC Nightly News, The Washington Post, The New York Times, and more. He and his team of crypto lawyers have:<\/p><ul><li>Traced stolen assets across multiple blockchains<\/li><li>Identified criminal wallet addresses<\/li><li>Partnered with exchanges and VASPs to freeze wallets<\/li><li>Obtained injunctions freezing over 30 wallets containing tens or hundreds of millions in suspected stolen crypto<\/li><\/ul><p>Our team has a deep, practical understanding of digital assets and how to prove it in court.<\/p><h3>Trial Lawyers Who Can Explain Crypto to Judges &amp; Juries<\/h3><p>Crypto cases often require explaining blockchains, smart contracts, wallets, transactions, tokenomics, and on-chain evidence.<\/p><p>Geoff Berg is widely known for his ability to break down complex blockchain concepts, a critical advantage in front of judges and juries.<\/p><h3>Nationwide Commercial Litigation Experience<\/h3><p>Based in Houston, Berg PC litigates cases nationwide, including San Francisco, Los Angeles, Seattle, Denver, Austin, Dallas, Chicago, New York, Philadelphia, DC, Boston, and Miami.<\/p><h3>Flexible Flat-Fee Litigation Options<\/h3><p>Where appropriate, the firm offers predictable flat monthly litigation fees, eliminating surprise bills and aligning incentives.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c69b4f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3c69b4f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" dat